  "body": "# Components\r\n\r\n## Application Security Management (WAF)\r\n\r\n* :bug: Add AppSec response-phase blocking to the Jetty 12 instrumentation (#13318 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Defer Jetty 12 request completion until a mid-handler blocking write finishes (#13493 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Fix Spring MVC 7 SmartHttpMessageConverter bodies not reaching the WAF (#13525 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Fix hanging Tomcat block response for rejected encoded-slash paths (#13543 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Complete Jetty 12.1 ee10 async requests left suspended by a blocking response (#13548 - @jandro996)\r\n\r\n# Instrumentations\r\n\r\n## Jetty instrumentation\r\n\r\n* :bug: Add AppSec response-phase blocking to the Jetty 12 instrumentation (#13318 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Defer Jetty 12 request completion until a mid-handler blocking write finishes (#13493 - @jandro996)\r\n* :bug: Complete Jetty 12.1 ee10 async requests left suspended by a blocking response (#13548 - @jandro996)\r\n\r\n## Spring instrumentation\r\n\r\n* :bug: Fix Spring MVC 7 SmartHttpMessageConverter bodies not reaching the WAF (#13525 - @jandro996)\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 1
